Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:04.44,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,Kirishima-kun, it feels \Nlike it's been ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:06.41,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,Did you get a girlfriend or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.71,0:00:09.31,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You really wanna know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.31,0:00:11.73,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,The truth is, there's this girl I like...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:15.49,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,Wow, you're actually talking about \Nother girls at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:17.42,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,What's she like? Let me see a pic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:19.45,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,She's from Osaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:22.50,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,This sucks... I can't \N{\i1}stand{\i0} chicks like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:26.00,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,Also, are these all candid pics?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:27.20,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:30.00,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yeah, she won't let me take any pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:36.02,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I get the feeling if I do anything too shady, \Nshe's willing to die to take me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:38.37,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,Sounds like she really hates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.37,0:00:40.91,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,She's never actually said \Nthat before, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.91,0:00:42.77,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Even if she's mad every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.53,0:00:45.73,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,Who's mad every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.73,0:00:46.89,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,You should give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:49.58,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Give it up? When I love her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.58,0:00:51.96,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Do I really have to give up \Non her when I'm in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:54.90,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,She might even have a guy \Nin Osaka that she likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:00:56.92,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,What if she's in a \Nlong-distance relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.40,0:01:00.06,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,That sounds like it'd be \Npretty hot in its own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.71,0:01:03.78,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,You're so much of a freak, I'm \Nstarting to pity this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:06.94,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,And I don't see why you're so \Nfixated on her in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.33,0:01:10.18,Default,Ayano,0,0,0,,If she's mad all the time, that's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:46.14,sign_generic,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(450,1)\bord0\b1\c&HB9C4BF&\move(362,167,445,167)}The {\c&H2100B6&}Triangle {\c&HB9C4BF&}From {\c&H2100B6&}Hell
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:51.84,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Who's there... Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:55.97,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No, I'm in Tokyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.91,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Tokyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:12.65,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:16.29,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No! That was {\i1}definitely{\i0} Kirishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:19.26,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I locked all the doors...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:20.33,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Did he pick the locks?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:22.59,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He'd have to actually cut the chain, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.41,0:03:26.08,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And what was he even after?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:29.67,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Is he bored enough of me \Nto try and kill me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:33.80,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:37.38,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:39.18,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I've gotten so used to his shit by now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:41.60,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,that it don't even bother me anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:44.88,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,This is getting ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:48.85,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,For now, I'll change the lock on the front \Ndoor, and for protection, I oughta...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:51.87,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Well, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:57.39,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:04:00.75,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell is doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.75,0:04:02.87,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And is that... blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:10.06,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If he's trying to kill me in \Nmy sleep, he'll get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:14.71,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Worst comes to worst, the \Nsecond he touches me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:23.02,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,H-He's braiding my hair?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:28.19,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Enough's enough! I can't take it no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.45,0:04:30.44,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What in the hell are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:36.70,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Oh, you scared me. You were awake, Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:41.31,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Y-Y-You're the one who scared {\i1}me{\i0}, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:43.56,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, that was kind of a reflex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:46.80,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Seriously, sorry. I didn't hurt you, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:48.06,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Put a sock in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:50.91,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What the hell were you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:53.43,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And how did you get in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:55.04,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:57.40,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I used aluminum foil to make a replica key.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.27,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And some string took care of the chain...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:00.60,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You friggin' criminal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.56,0:05:07.54,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Y'know what? Sit right there. \NYou're getting a lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:08.27,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:13.81,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm done trying to use abstracts like \Ncrime and common sense with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:18.07,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Listen up. You don't open someone's room \Nwithout permission, much less waltz in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:21.84,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Not just because it's common frickin' \Nsense, but because I {\i1}do not{\i0} like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:22.74,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:23.68,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.68,0:05:25.68,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Okay, next subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:30.14,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Why in the hell were you in my room, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.32,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.99,0:05:37.78,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I just realized, you always \Nlook mad whenever I see you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.78,0:05:40.95,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And someone pointed out \Nthat maybe you hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:45.00,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Which made me wanna see how you \Nlook when you're sleeping...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.43,0:05:48.25,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I mean, no one's mad when \Nthey're asleep, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:51.34,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Plus, that way I can look at you all I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.34,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Y'know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.83,0:05:57.49,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Considering how pretty much everything \Nyou do is on the wrong side of the law,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.49,0:05:59.71,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,how am I supposed to look, other than mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:01.58,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're even hurt, today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:02.34,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.62,0:06:06.42,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Tachibana-san let me have it \Nbecause I was out past curfew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:09.60,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Curfew?! You've got a curfew?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:11.35,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yeah, 1AM.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.35,0:06:12.84,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Not that I ever actually stick to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:17.36,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Are you trying to say you \Ndon't want to make me mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:18.64,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how that's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:20.43,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's less that I don't \Nwant to make you mad...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:22.11,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,and more I wanna see you \Nwhen you're not mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:26.83,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Well, for starters, how about \Nyou actually abide by that curfew?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:30.84,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You can't, can you? That's \Nwhat I'm getting at here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:32.58,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Between how you won't stick \Nto simple rules
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:34.48,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,and how you've got other \Ngirls all over you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:37.84,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,anyone would figure it out \Nafter two or three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:38.86,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:43.40,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You've got a mark on the back of your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:47.09,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm surprised at how obvious\Nyou can be sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.09,0:06:50.13,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The thing is, I'm pretty good \Nat picking up on that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:52.73,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Probably because my grandpa \Ngets around a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:55.59,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If he had a kid with every one of his lovers,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:59.24,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,my family tree'd be more complex \Nthan a map of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:01.65,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} don't have any kids running \Naround already, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:05.36,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I think that... isn't an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:07.88,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Well, get it together, lover boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.69,0:07:10.48,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:13.94,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It's just... you noticed, \Nbut you don't seem mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:15.77,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Why would I be mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.77,0:07:18.66,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Well... I was fooling \Naround with another girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:23.34,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And you're free to do so. I won't get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:25.18,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,That's really generous of you, Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:27.79,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Naw, I'm a hothead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:31.08,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If the guy I liked was fooling \Naround on me, I'd kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.39,0:07:32.51,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.51,0:07:35.18,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Well, if that's true, shouldn't \Nyou want to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:38.92,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No, because I don't like you, \Nand I don't kill for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:41.90,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Do you hate me, Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:43.86,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's that coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:46.68,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I've been enjoying every \Nday, with you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.07,0:07:50.44,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,The thought of you being home \Nmakes me want to rush back,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:54.23,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,and having you with me even \Nmakes school more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.23,0:07:59.75,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Y'know, for such a brutal dude, you \Nsound like a grade schooler sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:01.47,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Do you hate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.88,0:08:05.52,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I don't avoid you because I hate you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.52,0:08:08.96,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I do it because I never have any \Nidea what you're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:13.17,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You refuse to do stuff you're uninterested in,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.17,0:08:16.51,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,but when you do something, you go \Nall in. It's almost refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.51,0:08:18.46,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You don't put on airs.\NYou're always consistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.93,0:08:21.97,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If you've got any good points, \NI'd say that covers them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:27.43,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,For now, I'm gonna put a bandage on, \Nand once that's done I want you out—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.43,0:08:29.68,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I love you too, Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.47,0:08:35.21,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm gonna work hard so that when \NI fool around, you'll wanna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:37.95,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What is your problem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:43.21,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It's hot... and I ended up \Nnot gettin' enough sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:46.20,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Good morning, Yoshino. You've \Ngot a package from Osaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.45,0:08:50.79,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks. Is that for me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.79,0:08:53.21,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Nah, this is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:56.21,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I sent a letter to Boss Somei, \Nso it's probably the response.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:08:59.61,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You wrote Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.61,0:09:01.28,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It was a letter of apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.28,0:09:05.15,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Since I dragged you around the other \Nnight and even got you hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.15,0:09:06.84,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I called him too, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:09.49,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're weirdly considerate sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:11.77,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What'd you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.77,0:09:13.34,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:16.00,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Just some photo album with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:18.61,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You'd be surprised by how normal he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:20.92,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Couldn't fight to save his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.92,0:09:24.46,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,and he had a hate for yakuza that made him \Nbutt heads with Grandpa all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:27.89,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He moved out and got married as \Nsoon as he graduated high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.12,0:09:31.52,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If I'm being honest, since he died \Nin an accident before I was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.52,0:09:33.82,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I don't have a strong sense of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:35.37,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,An accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.73,0:09:38.93,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.93,0:09:40.99,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:44.70,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Y'know, Boss Somei is coming to \NTokyo the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:48.40,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He didn't mention anything. What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.63,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,There's an assembly for the Goyu-kai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:55.41,Default,Ebine,0,0,0,,I appreciate you all for making \Nthe time to join us tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.41,0:10:02.07,Default,Ebine,0,0,0,,Especially Lieutenants \NSomei Renji and Azuma Narumi
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:01.28,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\3c&HF0F6F3&\c&H111411&\pos(110,42)}Kirigaya-gumi Lieutenant\N{\fs18}Somei Renji
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:04.04,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\3c&HF0F6F3&\c&H111411&\pos(114,41)}Kirigaya-gumi Lieutenant\N{\fs18}Azuma Narumi
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:06.34,Default,Ebine,0,0,0,,of the Kirigaya-gumi who \Nhave made quite the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:06.91,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\3c&HF0F6F3&\c&H111411&\pos(540,73)}Himetorano Clan Chairman\N{\fs18}Suga Ranzo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:09.54,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\3c&HF0F6F3&\c&H111411&\pos(539,48)}Tsuwabuki Clan Secretary General\N{\fs18}Asebi Sho
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:10.65,Default,Ebine,0,0,0,,Our agenda tonight, as the Kanto Goyu-kai,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:12.42,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\3c&HF0F6F3&\c&H111411&\pos(537,46)}Tsuwabuki Clan Chairman\N{\fs18}Keyaki Katsuto
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:14.35,Default,Ebine,0,0,0,,is to pool our wits beyond the \Ndistinctions of east and west,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:15.30,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\3c&HF0F6F3&\c&H111411&\pos(509,68)}Tokusa Clan Acting Chairman\N{\fs18}Miyama Gaku
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:17.39,Default,Ebine,0,0,0,,so that we can contribute to the further \Nadvancement of our organizations,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:18.68,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\3c&HF0F6F3&\c&H111411&\pos(537,35)}Tokusa Clan General Director\N{\fs18}Akime Hishiba
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:19.85,Default,Ebine,0,0,0,,both collective and individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:23.68,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\3c&HF0F6F3&\c&H111411&\pos(547,92)}Goyu-kai Chair \NKatabami Clan Chairman \N{\fs18}Ebine Reiji
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.85,0:10:21.93,Default,Ebine,0,0,0,,Here's to collaboration.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:27.05,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,The Kanto Goyu-kai is a sort of social \Ngroup for the yakuza groups in Kanto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:29.39,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,There's a dinner held four times a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.39,0:10:32.43,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,and the heads of the \Naffiliated groups attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.43,0:10:34.82,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Think of it as a political summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:37.31,top,Renji,0,0,0,,Business doin' good?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.18,0:10:38.97,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You used to have to be a \Ngroup from Kanto to join,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.31,0:10:39.94,top,Asebi,0,0,0,,The iron I bought the other \Nday has been really impressing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:43.44,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,but now they've got the Kirigaya-gumi \Nfrom Kansai added to their number.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:43.45,top,Akishiba,0,0,0,,Really? Well, as far as we've been...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:46.47,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I had no idea at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.47,0:10:49.63,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,And that's the way it should stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:53.96,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,Don't go sticking your nose into it like you \Ndid with the Akaza Enterprises business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:59.59,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Y'know, when you mentioned your father, \Nit reminded me of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:57.94,top,Tachibana,0,0,0,,What the hell is this, Sota? \NIt tastes amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.94,0:11:01.60,top,Inamori,0,0,0,,Oh, we had some leftover okara, \Nso I made cookies out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.59,0:11:01.60,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Here's an old picture of the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:05.12,top,Tachibana,0,0,0,,What are you, a broad? \NDon't make it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.01,0:11:03.86,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Boss Somei is in it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:07.25,top,Tachibana,0,0,0,,But if you do, put some more sugar in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:08.35,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wait... is this Boss Miyama, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:11.59,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's him when he was younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:12.94,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:14.61,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He looks exactly like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.61,0:11:16.65,Default,KIrishima,0,0,0,,You really think the \Nresemblance is that strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:19.62,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It's not a "resemblance"! \NYou literally {\i1}are{\i0} him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.93,0:11:24.38,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Man, this picture makes the two \Nof them look pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.73,0:11:27.67,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,They probably were actually good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:33.63,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,The boss hates photos, so these ten are the \Nonly ones of him from when he was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.88,0:11:37.62,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And Boss Somei is in all ten of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:40.85,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Grandpa probably forced him to join in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:42.88,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,His own pictures were always \Nreally shaky, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.88,0:11:45.47,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,If you think about it, that \Nmeans they were close enough
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:48.51,Default,Tachibana,0,0,0,,that the boss didn't mind being \Nforced to take a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:50.83,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,That about covers it, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.91,0:11:55.27,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Were they close with this guy, too? \NHe's part of the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:58.60,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Oh, that's Boss Akime from \Nthe Ryuzetsu Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.60,0:12:01.03,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,They go way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.03,0:12:04.68,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,The Ryuzetsu Family are like us, \Nsubordinates of the Tokusa Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.59,0:12:09.54,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,All three of them are heads \Nof major organizations now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.75,0:12:14.79,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,It's kind of amazing to think about \Nhow they used to all pal around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.12,0:12:20.19,Default,Reiji,0,0,0,,Gaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.94,0:12:23.03,Default,Reiji,0,0,0,,How've you been, lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:23.90,Default,Gaku,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.90,0:12:26.20,Default,Reiji,0,0,0,,Man, you sound half-asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:28.46,Default,Reiji,0,0,0,,You never did have a lotta pep in you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:32.22,Default,Gaku,0,0,0,,I'm not half-asleep. I've been\N drinking, so I {\i1}want{\i0} to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.67,0:12:34.20,Default,Reiji,0,0,0,,You still can't hold your alcohol?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:37.10,Default,Gaku,0,0,0,,I don't need to. I usually\Nchoose not to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.10,0:12:40.49,Default,Reiji,0,0,0,,Your poison was usually sweet \Nstuff instead of booze, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.49,0:12:42.07,Default,Reiji,0,0,0,,Got some candy for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:44.46,Default,Reiji,0,0,0,,They were handing out \Ntissues by the station too,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:46.06,Default,Reiji,0,0,0,,and I got two so you can have—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:48.75,Default,Gaku,0,0,0,,Man, knock it off. I don't need \None, so don't stick it in my—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.75,0:12:50.28,Default,Akishiba,0,0,0,,Renji. It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.51,0:12:53.16,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Hey, Akishiba! It's been ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.16,0:12:55.89,Default,Akishiba,0,0,0,,You're as rowdy as ever, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:12:56.72,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,That right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:12:59.77,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Here, got a candy for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:01.04,Default,Akishiba,0,0,0,,Don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:04.08,Default,Yakuza,0,0,0,,Boss, I've brought the car \Naround. We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:05.51,Default,Akishiba,0,0,0,,Let's get a move on, Gaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.51,0:13:06.72,Default,Gaku,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.92,0:13:11.45,Default,Suga,0,0,0,,Hey, Renji, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.45,0:13:13.58,Default,Suga,0,0,0,,You ready to get some drinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:15.17,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,Sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:18.36,Default,Renji,0,0,0,,I was just thinking I \Ncould go for a few more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:19.68,Default,Suga,0,0,0,,Let's get going, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:25.69,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,An album?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.69,0:13:29.67,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Yeah. There oughta be another one \Napart from the one they sent...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:30.94,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Where are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.94,0:13:32.94,italics,Shoma,0,0,0,,Over by my school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:38.40,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Well, next time you're in Osaka, \Ncould you check for it in my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:41.64,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll look for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.64,0:13:42.88,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.81,0:13:49.46,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Hotei-san! Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.47,0:13:52.22,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\3c&HF0F6F3&\c&H0D100E&\pos(527,54)}Somei-gumi Member\NHotei Taketo
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:52.22,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoshino. You been good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:55.50,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Real good! Where's Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.89,0:13:57.77,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,Had his regular meeting at HQ,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:14:00.19,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,so he went back to Osaka \Nwithout me last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:02.94,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,You know how busy he is, \Nso try and forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.37,0:14:06.07,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,You hungry? Wanna eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:10.10,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm good. I've got a lunch date later today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.48,0:14:13.07,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,With Boss Miyama's grandson?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.07,0:14:15.05,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Well, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.05,0:14:16.74,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,What's he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.73,0:14:20.53,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,You caused some trouble together\N the other day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.53,0:14:23.22,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,Has he been dragging you around at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:28.81,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No, I wouldn't say that. But when \Nyou ask me to describe him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.13,0:14:31.64,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fade(200,1)\c&HCFD9D0&\fs16\frz346.3\pos(587,41)}Masochist
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:31.64,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fade(200,1)\c&HCFD9D0&\fs16\frz358\pos(467,22)}Self-Destructive
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:31.64,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fade(200,1)\c&HCFD9D0&\fs16\frz4.695\pos(176,18)}Womanizer
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:31.64,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fade(200,1)\c&HCFD9D0&\fs16\frz12.09\pos(65,28)}Fake Smile
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:34.73,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If I had to pick one thing, I'd \Nsay he's really mentally durable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.73,0:14:36.15,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:39.89,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,Well, tell him you wanna drop by Osaka \Nduring summer vacation to check in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:41.24,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:43.65,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,Ain't that the sensible \Nthing to do in most cases?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.65,0:14:47.30,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,I know this might sound obnoxious, \Nbut I've been around you the most
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:52.02,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,since you were a baby, and I tend to \Nthink I've taken the most care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:56.59,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,No, that's dead accurate. \NYou basically raised me, Hotei-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.59,0:14:59.35,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I barely remember seeing Grandpa \Naround when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.35,0:15:02.78,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,Just... don't actually \Ntell him that, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:08.56,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,Look, the thing is, I wanna see \Nif I can trust this kid to look after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.83,0:15:10.56,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,But I don't wanna force it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:17.31,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Nah, I think if I brought it up, he'd \Nprobably wanna drop by as early as tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:20.94,sign_generic,Signs; right to left,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs20\c&H323032&\blur1\3c&H8FF9E7&\pos(555,40)}Hello, it's nice\N to meet you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:20.94,sign_generic,{train sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs20\c&H323032&\blur1\3c&H8EF06A&\pos(77,40)}I'm Miyama \NKirishima!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.43,0:15:20.94,sign_generic,{train sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEDFF61&\fnComic Sans MS\c&H454446&\blur1\pos(320,23)\fade(150,1)}Shin-Osaka Station
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.31,0:15:20.94,sign_generic,{train sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEDFF61&\fnComic Sans MS\bord1\c&H454446&\blur1\fs15\pos(261,128)}Shin-Kobe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.43,0:15:20.94,sign_generic,{train sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEDFF61&\fnComic Sans MS\fs15\bord1\c&H454446&\blur1\pos(383,128)}Kyoto
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:23.66,Default,Hotei,0,0,0,,Hey, Shoma. You're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.00,0:15:28.70,Default,Yakuza,0,0,0,,Sorry to bug you, Inamori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:32.14,Default,Yakuza,0,0,0,,The room that's locked over in \Nthe separate storage building...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:33.81,Default,Yakuza,0,0,0,,Should I clean it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.81,0:15:35.47,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,That leads to the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.47,0:15:37.87,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,Even if you find it unlocked, \Ndon't ever go down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:38.97,Default,Yakuza,0,0,0,,The basement?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.33,0:15:41.41,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,They apparently threw any members
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:44.53,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,who were addicted to drugs \Ndown there to get sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.93,0:15:50.21,Default,Inamori,0,0,0,,Kirishima-san uses it now... \Nkinda weird that he does, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.21,0:15:54.71,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Sure, that's fine. It's been a while \Nsince you've seen him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:56.73,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Just let me know if you're going to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:01.66,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'll come pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:04.48,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Who travels overnight without \Na change of clothes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:08.37,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I just came to drop this \Noff for you, Yoshino-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.37,0:16:13.23,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The album, right? Thanks! But you \N{\i1}are{\i0} spending the night, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:15.52,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Now get changed, already!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.33,0:16:26.61,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Did you head back to Osaka last night \Nand then come straight to Tokyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.61,0:16:28.19,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Yeah, that covers it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.19,0:16:31.13,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're as light on your feet as ever, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.13,0:16:33.50,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I wanted to check on you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:36.39,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,There's no telling what you'll \Ndo when you lose your temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:39.93,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I could say that right back to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.93,0:16:42.79,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You were still only 13 when \Nyou joined up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:45.64,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What kinda middle schooler \Npicks fights with yakuza?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:48.51,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I was drunk at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.51,0:16:50.89,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Liar. I know it wasn't just booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:54.38,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're lucky you picked \Na fight with Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.38,0:16:56.65,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Most of our guys are no good,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.65,0:16:59.16,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,but if you had kept living the way you were,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:01.73,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,you woulda ended up even worse off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.73,0:17:02.92,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:06.18,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,'Scuse me, miss? I'd like to buy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:07.66,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Put a damn shirt on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:16.30,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs11\3c&HEDF0ED&\c&H3C3E3C&\frz13.27\move(391,322,395,333)}Toriashi Shoma
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.30,0:17:17.93,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\p1\fscy220\alpha&H20&\c&HE8EEEB&}m 0 0 l 200 0 200 60 0 60
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.30,0:17:17.93,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\fs11\pos(24,17)}...After the death of his mother, adopted \Nby his paternal grandparents.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.30,0:17:17.93,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\fs11\pos(24,46)}...put into protective care for a time due \Nto conflict with grandparents.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.30,0:17:17.93,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\fs11\pos(25,78)}...after dropping out of middle-school,\Nbegan living with his father.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.30,0:17:17.93,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\fs11\pos(24,109)}...ostensibly adopted by the leader of\N Somei-gumi, Somei Renji.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.41,0:17:20.50,Default,Kirishimia,0,0,0,,Toriashi Shoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:25.78,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You still eat a ton, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.78,0:17:29.27,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And would you cover up a little more?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.27,0:17:32.82,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The whole idea is to get them \Nwhere people can't see, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.10,0:17:34.31,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.19,0:17:38.32,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I don't get why you and \NKirishima even bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:41.07,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,What's he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.46,0:17:45.03,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Hotei-san asked me the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.03,0:17:46.29,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I didn't have a good answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:47.66,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:49.21,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,'Cuz I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:51.68,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,All I can say about the \Nguy is that he's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.68,0:17:55.35,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm probably better off not \Ntreating him like a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.35,0:17:56.71,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.71,0:17:58.29,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I've asked that, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:02.93,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,And this dude is serious about \Nmarrying you, Yoshino-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:06.02,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Sounds like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.02,0:18:09.13,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I dunno how serious to treat it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.13,0:18:11.17,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,And how do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:13.82,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Are you nuts? I ain't marrying that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:17.38,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The idea is to get as much of his \Nattention as I can over the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:20.33,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,dump him, and head home to Osaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.69,0:18:25.33,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Yoshino-san, do you know \Nhow you ended up in Tokyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.67,0:18:28.84,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What do you mean? It was Grandpa \Nbeing crazy, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:31.47,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,That's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.99,0:18:34.33,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Do you remember Suga Ranzo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:37.34,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,He's the chairman of the Himetorano Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:43.20,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I know him. Grandpa and I took a trip with \NSuga-san's family when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:46.98,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Do you know why he and the \Nboss are close, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:49.10,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Not really. They're friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.34,0:18:51.98,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Around the time the boss was my age,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.98,0:18:55.83,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,the 4th chairman of the Kirgayama-gumi \Nand Himetorano Clan's chairman
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:57.10,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,became sworn brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.02,0:19:00.94,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,The Himetorano Clan is\Npretty established in Kanto,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.94,0:19:04.18,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,and that was how HQ started \Ngaining ground in Tokyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.32,0:19:08.87,sign_generic,,0,0,0,,{\c&H312A29&\3c&H70FFFC&\b1\pos(273,157)\bord3\fade(1800,0)}Kiriyama
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.32,0:19:08.87,sign_generic,,0,0,0,,{\c&H312A29&\3c&H70FFFC&\b1\fs12\bord3\fade(1800,0)\pos(416,116)}Tokusa
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:08.87,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Which ended up resultin' in a pretty \Nbig fight with the Tokusa Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.23,0:19:13.52,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,But Grandpa and Boss Miyama \Nswore an oath last year, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:15.86,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Said the idea was to pursue \Na more amicable route...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.86,0:19:19.02,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,It might be the exact opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.67,0:19:24.99,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,When HQ and the Himetorano Clan \Nswore their oath, on the surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:28.85,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,it was about making things more \Npeaceful between the east and west.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.85,0:19:29.89,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:32.65,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,There might be more fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.65,0:19:35.59,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I dunno. The chance exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.59,0:19:38.28,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I think they've arranged to keep the boss
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:42.27,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,from making any aggressive moves \Nwhile you're in Tokyo, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.27,0:19:45.97,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Or maybe I'm overthinkin' it.\N Forget I said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.97,0:19:47.43,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get the tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.86,0:19:50.69,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Fighting, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.89,0:19:54.49,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,This sucks... I ate too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.49,0:19:58.27,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Whenever it's a buffet, I always try \Ntoo hard to get my money's worth...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.70,0:20:02.84,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm stuffed, I'm tired, and \NI wanna just conk out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.18,0:20:06.38,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You can take a nap if you want. \NYou're still good on time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:08.30,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:09.18,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Past nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.18,0:20:12.06,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Nine already? I don't wanna go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:15.67,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I think somethin' about seeing you has \Nmade me fed up with this whole deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.67,0:20:16.70,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,What deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:22.92,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wanting to beat Kirishima somehow, being \Nready to kill him before he kills me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.92,0:20:28.21,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Not showing any weakness, no matter what... \NIt's all I've been thinkin' about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.55,0:20:30.51,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Did you lose your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.51,0:20:31.95,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.76,0:20:39.53,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,My point is, in spite of all that, he's \Nthe only one I can turn to in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.53,0:20:41.96,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,He's always fulla surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:44.68,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Feels like no matter how \Nlong we spend together,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:47.36,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I can never tell which face is his real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.36,0:20:49.15,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And it's exhausting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.15,0:20:52.71,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Part of me wants to head home \Nwith you to Osaka, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:54.36,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Should we, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:21:01.23,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,If this guy were gone, you wouldn't have \Nto worry like this, right, Yoshino-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.71,0:21:05.86,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I can kill him so you don't have to, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.80,0:21:11.12,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What the hell? That's a real escalation...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:16.38,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Well, from what you said, he \Ndefinitely sounds like bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:18.96,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Maybe he's better off dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:23.83,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I'm no saint either, so killin' a \Nguy wouldn't be a big deal for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.62,0:21:29.93,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Now, hold on, it's not that bad yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.93,0:21:33.14,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I know. But when you're ready, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.94,0:21:35.38,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I'll be waitin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:40.41,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.19,0:21:53.38,flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Part of me wants to head home \Nwith you to Osaka, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:22:01.18,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You're not allowed to smoke on \Nthe street around here, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.29,0:22:08.01,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Toriashi Shoma-san. \NI'm Miyama Kirishima.
